+## 6. Fresh non-vacuity test
+
+I did not rely on candidate `spec-vacuity.k`. The fresh reviewer mutation is
+[`evidence/stage6/spec-fresh-vacuity.k`](evidence/stage6/spec-fresh-vacuity.k),
